& [DependencyFinding]
  + NHC-05 formation and implementation are not currently authorized
  + the general nested-host vision identifies custody ownership restart loss and recovery but is not an exact NHC-05 source and cannot silently supply its identities state machine commissions or effects
  + NHC-04 must first receive one separately supplied valid signed request pass positive four-file evidence positive-dependent adversaries final exact gates completion publication and post-push replay
  + signed NHC-04 plan solution matrix and phase-lock artifacts retain their immutable formation-era wording; current implementation disposition belongs in append-only sequence reentry audit and proof records rather than by mutating signed history

& [RequiredFutureSourceSurface]
  + [C01_consumption] one-use authorization consumption point monotonic sequence freshness expiry revocation and replay refusal
  + [C02_ownership] distinct session process model stream cancellation quarantine and recovery-owner identities with explicit leases and transfers
  + [C03_observation] exact executable and working-directory presence byte identity trust and host-policy observations without inferring compatibility
  + [C04_process] process-creation descendant model-load readiness exit and orphan boundaries with direct no-shell execution only if separately authorized
  + [C05_streams] stdin stdout stderr ownership bounded draining backpressure truncation closure and retained-byte receipts
  + [C06_cancellation] request delivery acknowledgement grace escalation terminal observation and uncertainty-preserving accounting
  + [C07_restart_loss] host child and evidence restart detection custody loss recovery reattachment impossibility and abandoned-state treatment
  + [C08_recovery] rollback quarantine named recovery owner cleanup commission retention and refusal when terminal descendants or ownership are uncertain
  + [C09_effect_broker] separately signed physical-effect broker host policy resource ceilings provider and model admission with no ambient authority

& [AdmissionOrder]
  + complete and bookend NHC-04
  + preserve one exact dictated NHC-05 source under source_documents before SJS processing
  + form audit delineation data dual-hemisphere threat seven-fold canonical specification matrix solution plan phase lock proof review and satisfaction signature
  + only then consider provider-free state-machine code; physical execution remains a later explicit commission even if pure NHC-05 code is authorized

& [Nonclaims]
