& [Disposition]
  + remain on NHC-04 external-fixture handoff; NHC-05 is dependency-described_but_not_authorized
  + dual formation verification deliberately caught and refused a transient attempted status edit to signed artifacts; the edit was removed before publication and no signed hash was refreshed or bypassed
